    "Before any complete data-only audit, its source was corrected to read the actual focused-summary field names and per-command log schema. The original reader, hold and exact source-only correction remain retained; Runtime code, test expectations and raw outcomes did not change.",
    "The first complete data-only audit passed with 378 bound inputs. No failed complete-audit attempt is part of this checkpoint.",
    "Six historical inventory profile commands and the aggregate retain exit 1. Thirty older unhealthy inventory rows remain unchanged. Two connected inventory cases newly fail with Error, and four connected controls are unhealthy TypeError observations; no health waiver or all-history-healthy claim applies.",
    "Six frozen historical JavaScript fixtures remain byte-exact. Private historical inventory wrappers use disposable realms and explicitly remove and restore newer configurable descriptors; the new independent fixture asserts the current 30-key prototype inventory.",
    "Preceding connected commit 53859161 has nine successful GitHub CI jobs. That evidence is separate from current candidate local validation."
  ],
  "tested_boundaries": [
    "Required nonnullable argument and authentic receiver ordering; canonical Document aliases; no authored coercion; argument-expression effects and throws occur before the read.",
    "Two literal 8-by-8 matrices cover all 128 ordered comparisons before and after reordering a mixed-depth tree. Six geometry witnesses cover both directions, exact work and one-short refusal, including accepted 256-edge snapshots and a separately added 257th ordinary parent edge.",
    "Malformed reached shape, backlinks, duplicate selected-child membership, endpoint and intermediate false canonical roots, and bounded cycles refuse explicitly on either complete walk. Same-ID local checks intentionally do not certify ancestors or off-path graph state.",
    "Separate first-walk, second-walk and final-sibling-scan terminal refusals retain prior authored effects and suppress catch/finally completion. Ignored extra-expression exhaustion occurs before native invocation. Small representative calls exercise every work cut; deep cases use exact and one-short endpoints.",
    "Saved native work/heap boundaries preserve metadata identity and execution cleanup; two live realms retain distinct cached metadata. Method body succeeds with exhausted owned-allocation allowance because it owns no traversal or payload storage.",
    "Page and confined-worker real-click witnesses preserve 22 captured IDs and create no click-time nodes. They check literal masks, saved and ordinary calls, the fcop move trace, template separation, reordered text, title/status, command order and a full literal reference canvas."
